  "text": "I fixed one bug, but I couldn't run the tests to confirm it: every test command (`npm test`, `node --test`) was blocked waiting for approval.\n\n**The bug:** in `sum()` at `math.js:3`, the loop started at `i = 1`, so it skipped the first value. I changed it to start at `i = 0`. `sum([1, 2, 3])` was returning 5 instead of 6, and `average([2, 4, 6])` returned 10/3 instead of 4.\n\n**Expected result:** reading `test/math.test.js` by hand, I expect this fix to make all 3 tests pass:\n- `sum adds all values`: was failing, should pass now\n- `average of values`: was failing, should pass now\n- `average of empty list is 0`: already passed\n\nTo confirm, approve `npm test` or run it yourself in the repository folder."
